  "aiContextParagraph": "The case follows the death of a student from SMAN 7 Malang, identified as Silva Nur Intania, after she was subjected to a physical assault. The incident has triggered widespread public concern regarding school bullying in Indonesia, with national leaders calling for a comprehensive investigation into the events, including potential negligence by school officials. Following the violence, 48 people were arrested after a crowd surrounded the home of one of the suspected perpetrators. Legislative figures, including the Chairman of Commission III of the House of Representatives, have publicly stated that those involved in the beating should face the full weight of the legal process and not be permitted to participate in school examinations. The victim, who was previously noted for having earned a scholarship to study in Korea, was the target of severe physical abuse that has sparked calls for legislative reforms to child protection laws.",
